%I A398540 #33 Aug 20 2026 18:31:00
%S A398540 5,7,5,4,7,2,3,8,1,5,1,1,1,5,2,2,5,2
%N A398540 Decimal expansion of the asymptotic ratio r_infty = lim_{n->oo} W(n+1)/W(n), where W(n) is the winning probability in the continuous n-slot proportional placement game (derived from the social media game 'The Number Challenge').
%C A398540 r_infty = lim_{n->oo} W(n+1)/W(n) = 0.5754723815...
%C A398540 The reciprocal 1/r_infty = 1.7377028544... is the radius of convergence of f(z) = Sum_{n>=0} W(n)*z^n.
%C A398540 W(2) = 3/4, W(3) = 83/162, W(4) = 55537/165888.
%D A398540 A. Serra, The Number Challenge: Asymptotic Analysis and Hidden Constant of a Recursive Placement Game, preprint, 2026.
%H A398540 Alessandro Serra, <a href="https://zenodo.org/records/21946055">The Number Challenge: A New Mathematical Constant Arising from a Recursive Placement Game</a>, Preprint (2026).
%F A398540 Equals lim_{n->oo} W(n+1)/W(n) where W(n) = (1/n)*Sum_{k=1..n} W(k-1)*W(n-k)*(I(k/n;k,n-k+1) - I((k-1)/n;k,n-k+1)), W(0)=W(1)=1, I(x;a,b) = regularized incomplete Beta function (conjectured limit, supported by Richardson extrapolation).
%F A398540 W(n) ~ c * d^n * sqrt(n), where d = A398540 = 0.575472381511152252... and c = 1.4424953427... - _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Aug 04 2026
%e A398540 0.5754723815...
%o A398540 (Python)
%o A398540 from scipy.special import betainc
%o A398540 def compute_Qk(k, n):
%o A398540     return betainc(k, n-k+1, k/n) - betainc(k, n-k+1, (k-1)/n)
%o A398540 def compute_W(n_max):
%o A398540     W = [1.0] * (n_max + 1)
%o A398540     for n in range(2, n_max + 1):
%o A398540         s = sum(2*W[k-1]*W[n-k]*compute_Qk(k,n) for k in range(1, n//2+1))
%o A398540         if n % 2 == 1:
%o A398540             k = (n+1)//2
%o A398540             s += W[k-1]*W[n-k]*compute_Qk(k,n)
%o A398540         W[n] = s/n
%o A398540     return W
%o A398540 # Test
%o A398540 W = compute_W(100)
%o A398540 print(f"W(2) = {W[2]}")
%o A398540 print(f"W(3) = {W[3]}")
%o A398540 print(f"W(4) = {W[4]}")
%o A398540 print(f"r(99) = {W[100]/W[99]}")
%K A398540 nonn,cons,more,changed
%O A398540 0,1
